<h1>Schemas</h1>
<p>A <strong>schema</strong> defines the structural contract for an <a href="/concepts/events">event</a>'s <code>payload</code>. While Godzilla enforces a standard top-level event envelope, schemas declare the exact data types, required properties, and value constraints of the user payload inside each event.</p>

<h2>Declaring event payload shapes</h2>
<p>Schemas in Godzilla use standard JSON Schema (draft-07) specifications. Each schema maps to an event <code>type</code> and declares what fields must be present and what data formats they must follow.</p>

