<h1>Migration guide (v1 → v2) <span class='chip chip--danger'>v1 retired</span></h1>
<p>v1 reached end of life on 2026-08-01 alongside the <a href="/changelog">webhooks GA changelog entry</a>. This guide covers the three breaking changes you need to handle to move a v1 integration to v2.</p>

<div class='alert alert--warning'>
