  <div class='alert__body'><p>The <a href="/api/pipelines">Pipelines</a> and <a href="/api/events">Events</a> endpoints now run on <strong>v3</strong> (<code>https://api.godzilladocs.dev/v3</code>). The v2 Events endpoint has been withdrawn entirely — make sure you direct event listing and replay requests directly to v3 when moving over.</p></div>
</div>

